8. Success Criteria

The project is successful if users can:

Register and log in securely.

Search alumni using filters.

View alumni profiles.

Send and receive messages.

Share posts and job opportunities.

Connect with alumni.

Receive notifications.

Allow the admin to manage users and reports.





9. Out of Scope

